---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="wrap section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <SectionHeading index="04" title="About" id="about">A little more context</SectionHeading>

  <div class="cols" data-reveal>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I studied Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning as an undergraduate at Anurag University in Hyderabad, where I also
        worked as a research assistant keeping departmental datasets and records consistent. I'm now in the M.S. program in Data
        Science, Analytics and Engineering at Arizona State University.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of what I build sits where data, models, and ordinary software meet. Lately that has meant a Zoom-sponsored
        fellowship building an in-meeting assistant, a static analyzer for Rust, and data and ML systems that are tested and
        measured rather than assumed to work. Each project's write-up documents its limitations next to its results.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before the fellowship I spent the summer as a full-time deskside support intern at ASU's MIX Center, resolving hardware,
        software, network, and account issues across classrooms and offices.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="aside">
      <p class="label">Looking for</p>
      <p>
        New grad and internship roles in software engineering, applied AI, and AI/ML or machine learning engineering.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-top: var(--section-gap);
  }

  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-7);
  }

  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 18rem;
      gap: var(--space-9);
    }
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: var(--width-prose);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  .aside {
    align-self: start;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
    border-top: var(--border-ink);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
</style>
